From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:37:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] autotests: add an integration test for back navigation
Description:
 Covers the state as seen by the compositor and by a shell client, back
 delivery and its suppression when the state is unavailable, destruction of
 the back navigation object, unmapping and remapping, a toplevel destroyed
 before its back navigation object, transient and modal dialogs and the lock
 screen.
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
